-- kurumba-lodge-hospark (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Kurumba Lodge in Polokwane offers luxury accommodation, fine dining and conference facilities in one place. Its 28 ensuite rooms are well appointed with modern amenities, and its self-catering units sit in a garden that the lodge describes as a private oasis.

