The lodge says safety and comfort come first, with its own reservoir and a backup generator to keep services running. Wi-Fi, laundry and ironing services are included, and the lodge is in the Hospital Park area of Polokwane.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://kurumba.co.za'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'kurumba-lodge-hospark' AND description = 'Kurumba Lodge is a guest house and conference venue in Hospital Park offering en-suite bedrooms alongside presidential, exclusive and honeymoon suites, plus a self-catering unit set in a manicured garden with a private braai area; it also has an on-site restaurant and conference rooms that can host functions and small weddings.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
